# Cookie Clicker, tiny edition.
# Shows: clicking on things, counters, buying helpers, and text in different colors.

game
  size 320 by 200
  background #2b2118

cookies starts at 0
helpers starts at 0
price starts at 10

thing cookie
  looks like peru circle 32
  starts at 128, 56

thing shop
  looks like sea green box 96 by 24
  starts at 208, 160

when mouse is clicked on the cookie
  add 1 to cookies
  change cookie to look like sandy brown circle 32

when mouse is clicked
  change cookie to look like peru circle 32

when mouse is clicked on the shop and cookies is more than price - 1
  subtract price from cookies
  add 1 to helpers
  add 5 to price

when every 1 second
  add helpers to cookies

when cookies is above 99
  show text "Cookie master!" at 8, 190 in gold

always
  show text "Cookies: {cookies}" at 8, 16 in wheat
  show text "Helpers: {helpers}" at 8, 30 in wheat
  show text "Buy helper ({price})" at 212, 176 in white
  show text "Click the cookie!" at 112, 140 in tan
